So, it should have gotten an unsigned int from the printed buffer at index=4, which should have been 0x000023dd (after swapping to LE). I have no idea where 4026531840 (0xF0000000) came from. That value is seemingly random every time it crashes.

Mucking around with this enough can eventually cause my JVM to hard crash...
